    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### qTox Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Commit Hash\n\n_No response_\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Qt Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start qTox\n2. Enter a chat where images/files have been sent\n3. Open text search dialog\n4. Close text search dialog\n5. Scroll up and down\n6. Open text search dialog again (If nothing of note happens, Repeat steps 3-5 until it does)\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\nThe green rectangles that come with a file/image message appear to get \"stuck\", or in other words remain partially rendered above or below the chat widget. Typically about a half of the green rectangle is left rendered above the chat or alternatively a thin strip of the green rectangle is rendered below the chat.\n\nThis bug appears to originate from the old qTox repo, since all of the versions at least I have used, in the span of the last 6 years had it.\n\nIt appears to be triggered by scrolling while using the _search dialog_ or alternatively (at least in older versions) it could be triggered also by _scrolling while in a call_ or sometimes also when qTox had to _fetch and display older chat logs._\n\nBased on prior observation, it appears that the green boxes somehow get rendered over the \"friend status and name\" part of the widget, or over the \"text prompt\" part of the widget and while the scrollable chat re-renders correctly on scrolling, the peripheral parts are stuck misrendered. \n\nThe issue usually fixes itself when switching between chats or whenever the widget is forcibly re-rendered by the program.\nThe issue also seems to fix itself, at least when the glitch is over the text prompt, by mouse hovering over it.\n\nAdditionally, sometimes, after this issue manifests, when you send a text message, it does not appear to show in the chat widget. Restarting seems to be the only effective way to fix this.\n\n\nAbove chat:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b989add-f204-41ca-9514-117686c27895)\n\nBelow chat (before mouse over):\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b5c576a2-5b3c-44b5-b1a6-06f342411a5c)\n\nBelow chat (after mouse over): \n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e180d50-726f-4635-9120-6302f0d72419)\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nNormal rendering, green file/image boxes disappearing as they should when out of scope.\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nSometimes\n\n### Operating System\n\nWindows\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n\n```",
